hands and shout "Hooray"!

00:23:31.944 --> 00:23:34.246
All you who want to party
like there's no rules...

00:23:34.246 --> 00:23:36.181
Keep on, keep on jamming?

00:23:36.282 --> 00:23:41.320
As we get mad, cry, and laugh...

00:23:41.420 --> 00:23:43.889
We take the past along with us.

00:23:43.989 --> 00:23:45.891
Yo! Are you gonna miss
the bus and show up late!?

00:23:45.891 --> 00:23:47.860
My manual drive is
raising the tension gage.

00:23:47.860 --> 00:23:50.062
<i>I say "I can do it!"
and fill up with confidence.</i>

00:23:50.162 --> 00:23:51.864
Ready, aim, fire! I don't know.

00:23:52.398 --> 00:23:53.832
Everyone who wants to
shout come on over!!

00:23:53.832 --> 00:23:55.401
We'll all burst out laughing!
Burst out running!

