00:24:25.331 --> 00:24:28.233
Here's the results of the
Janken Fortune Teller, nah-na-la!

00:24:28.233 --> 00:24:33.539
If you won, expand your knowledge
at the library and your luck will rise!

00:24:33.906 --> 00:24:37.609
Your superior top-secret
item is a homemade present!

00:24:38.777 --> 00:24:43.782
If you tied, folding the laundry might
turn out to be a good change of pace.

00:24:44.383 --> 00:24:49.655
And if you lost, be careful you don't dirty your
clothes when you eat Neapolitan spaghetti!

00:24:49.655 --> 00:24:51.924
Bobobo-bo Bo-bobo

00:24:52.558 --> 00:24:55.828
Huh? It looks like
we've warped somewhere.

00:24:55.828 --> 00:24:59.264
Looks like it's finally time to take on the
final member of the Six Cyber Knights!

00:24:59.798 --> 00:25:03.135
I'll bet he's really strong,
if he's the last one!

00:25:03.902 --> 00:25:06.171
Hey, what's with the glum face, Bo-bobo?

00:25:06.171 --> 00:25:09.375
I can't tell if he is an onion or garlic!

00:25:09.375 --> 00:25:10.876
Wow! I really can't tell!

00:25:10.943 --> 00:25:12.578
